is no different. There, the political parties led by Ying Zheng and Buwei Lü continue their inner conflict. Having played the role of king in the coalition battle, Zheng has the trust of the people—but Lü is far from out of the fight. In 18 months, he plans to interrupt Zheng's coming-of-age ceremony.\n\nMeanwhile, a Zhao army numbering 20,000 troops has set out toward Qin. In the royal court, due to the lack of generals capable of responding to the incoming threat, Lü slyly suggests that Zheng take command. However, Cheng Jiao, Zheng's half-brother, volunteers instead. As they grew to trust each other during the coalition battle, Zheng now accepts Jiao as his replacement.\n\nHowever, the Zhao forces retreat a mere half-day after clashing with Jiao's army. With trouble quickly brewing in the shadows, the internal struggle of Qin is only complicated further. There are only two men Zheng feels he can rely on: Bi, a general who commands 30,000 men; and Xin, the leader of the Fei Xin force.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"War","rank":100,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Historical","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Seinen","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ancient China","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Kingdom Season 4","english":"Kingdom Season 4","native":"キングダム 第4シリーズ","romaji":"Kingdom 4th Season","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"王者天下 第四季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Kingdom 4"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Kingdom (2022)"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"キングダム (2022)"}]},"trailer":{"id":"RZBnt